The verdict

«Resident Evil: Resistance» is a great example of modern today online games, without any objective but extremely fun. It has great potential. It’s has everything it needs to the popular online game.
There are a lot of great choices in the balance of the game, but it's not enough. There is room for improvement. It needs long support.
An indicated list of the issues to be resolved, in my humble opinion:
1) Dedicated servers;
2) Matchmaking improvements;
3) Balance improving, refinement;
4) Some sort of anti-cheat;
5) Cross-platform play.

